{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0JvbGx5d29vZC8xOTkwLS1CZWZvcmUvS2FhbGlhJTIwJTI4MTk4MSUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"Kaalia","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/i8zLyTb3CuGwpVDj6irbiWBFsgN.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cnx5NSH9quhGHVJ6kBon9WwKw0Z.jpg","description":"Kaalia - A name that spells terror in the minds of people and the police, but Kaalia was not always like this. Years ago he was a mere simpleton. Living simply in a shanty chawl with his elder brother, Shyamlal, Bhabhi (Sister- in-law), whom he adored and their daughter Munni. Apart from them there is no one else in Kallu's little world until one day, an enemy in the guise of Shahani Seth appears. Shahani shatters the happiness in Kallu's life. That same day the young Kallu dies, and the dreaded Kaalia is born. Kaalia's main motive in life becomes wealth, and to destroy Shahani. This path of violence leads Kaalia to inspector Raghubir Singh's jail. Outside of jail, Shahani starts reclaiming his power, and inside jail, Kaalia clashes with Raghubir Singh.\n\nReleased 25 Dec 1981 · India · Language: Hindi · 175 min\n\nOn your server — Audio: Hindi (from file names)","releaseInfo":"1981","genres":["Action","Crime","Bollywood"],"imdbRating":"6.1","runtime":"175 min","cast":["Amitabh Bachchan","Asha Parekh","Amjad Khan","Parveen Babi","Pran","Kader Khan","Raza Murad","K.N. Singh"],"director":["Tinnu Anand"],"released":"1981-12-25T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Tinnu Anand","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/6fkEiZKNp6jnOQmfQKEjVinhUeL.jpg"},{"name":"Amitabh Bachchan","character":"Kallia","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/u69PvpWqGkywSm0YjFiw77j9eqS.jpg"},{"name":"Asha Parekh","character":"Shanti","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/p9AdJWhZNL7v7yWlduykcE7EiAj.jpg"},{"name":"Amjad Khan","character":"Shani Seeth","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/52s7Cbukn505Bo0JzLdurF8RXb.jpg"},{"name":"Par